OOF Fibonacci — iterative approach using UGGA WHILE
OOF Prints the first 20 Fibonacci numbers.

OOGA a BE 0
OOGA b BE 1
OOGA count BE 0

SAY "Fibonacci sequence (first 20):"

UGGA WHILE count SMALLR 20
    SAY a
    OOGA temp BE a PLUS b
    a GETS b
    b GETS temp
    count GETS count PLUS 1
UGHA

SAY "---"

OOF Bonus: recursive Fibonacci (shows recursion depth)
MAGIC fib(n)
    IFF n SMALLR IS 1
        GIVEBACK n
    UGHA
    GIVEBACK fib(n MINUS 1) PLUS fib(n MINUS 2)
UGHA

SAY "fib(10) ="
SAY fib(10)

SAY "fib(15) ="
SAY fib(15)
